- `dao.stream.md` OD-4: compaction/destruction of a complete-history transport; bounds the session-facts medium.
- `dao.jing.content` request/answer convention: a plan section (`dao.stream.remote.implementation-plan.md` §1), not rules; the Mode 2 notice and the per-lineage gated pair depend on it.
